From bc8d3a3b7a11cd62bade8077bf887d911b1f28c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: amanraj069 <amanraj3567@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 15:56:35 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Pool Gemini keys and fail over across keys and models

Read GEMINI_API_KEY1, GEMINI_API_KEY2, ... (numeric order, blanks skipped,
legacy GEMINI_API_KEY still honoured) into a sticky key pool modelled on
intake's GeminiKeyPool. A rate-limited or rejected key is benched and the
next key retries the same model; an overloaded or missing model moves down
the ladder, which now starts at gemini-3.7-flash. GEMINI_MODELS replaces
the ladder outright.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
